.Dd $Mdocdate$
.Dt JDK-CA-CERTS 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm jdk-ca-certs
.Nd convert a certificate bundle into a JDK-compatible store
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar in-cert.pem
.Ar out-jdk-cacerts
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility converts a PEM-formatted certificate bundle into a certificate store
that can be used by the Java Development Kit
.Pq JDK .
The JDK uses a standard PKCS#12 file whose
.Fa certBag Ns No s
have an Oracle-specific key usage attribute.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
The
.Nm
utility exits zero on success, and >0 if an error occurs.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr openssl 1 ,
.Xr crypto 3 ,
.Xr PEM_X509_INFO_read_bio 3
.Sh STANDARDS
.Rs
.%T Internet X.509 Public Key Infrastructure Certificate and CRL Profile
.%R RFC 5280
.Re
.Pp
.Rs
.%T PKCS #12: Personal Information Exchange Syntax v1.1
.%R RFC 7292
.Re
.Pp
.Rs
.%T Textual Encodings of PKIX, PKCS, and CMS Structures
.%R RFC 7468
.Re
.Sh BUGS
Diagnostics are lacking and the code is not written to be portable
to operating systmes other than
.Ox .
